Z||000027||tgowens||08-06-2000||05:04 PM||||<B>DaRkLoRD</B> thanks for doing that one - that's kinda cool!!.....<B>fierodave</B> i am working on a couple for you now -- I really think you should take that bra off (that didn't sound right...) and send it to me tho - it would look much better on my GT.....<B>hugh</B> don't worry about that , we are all here to have a good time and we share a commonality - the Fiero -- email me a picture.....<B>pHoOl</B> get a picture on here that I can copy (or email me one) and I'll do one for you.....<B>Fret Naught</B> I am going to send you a new one so hang in there -- but......upload the image to your ISP server, then go to the "profile" section of this forum, go to the "signature" section and reference the image as [IMG] using the lower case brackets - put in <A HREF="http://xxxxx.xxx/~fretnaught/img.gif" TARGET=_blank>http://xxxxx.xxx/~fretnaught/img.gif</A>  and then close it with [/IMG] -- the xxxxx.xxx is the name of your ISP (location of the file) and the ~fretnaught is the location of your specific file on that server -- email me if I have confused you......<B>stimpy</B> thanks - as usual you come to the aid and rescue of us all -- i am working on yours too.....<B>pHoOl</B> see the above instruction - this way it puts the image on YOUR server and not on Cliff's.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">                <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A><p>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 08-06-2000).]||||reg||1
